  "description": "Sua’s biggest dream is fulfilled when she is given the chance to costar with her lifelong role model, Seo-Hyeon, in a movie. But the line between professional and personal feelings starts to blur when the two women need to shoot a steamy bedroom scene. Unable to get her act together, Sua asks Seo-Hyeon to help her practice the scene. It should be okay since it’s just acting... right?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Part of Bomtoon's and Lezhin's Jeonmunjing Ungni Danpyeonseon (전문직 웅니 단편선) Collection.*",
